@DocumentAssistant.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5056

### Upload a PDF (change the path to a PDF on your machine)
POST {{DocumentAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary--

### List documents
GET {{DocumentAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Get a document by id
GET {{DocumentAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Search: compare mode=vector, keyword and hybrid
GET {{DocumentAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search?q=Can I use beta software in production?&mode=hybrid&limit=5
Accept: application/json

###
